	(text "DESIGN NOTE:\nI_LED = 0.2 V / R318\n\nR318 is initially populated as 10R (approximately 20 mA\ntotal backlight current).\n\nDo not infer the required current from panel size or the\napproximately 29 V VLED rail alone; the panel may contain\none or multiple parallel LED strings.\n\n\nMeasure VLED and total LED current.\n\nConfirm stable startup, uniform brightness,\nand absence of flicker.\nCheck panel, connector, and driver temperature after \nsustained operation.\nIncrease current only against a panel data sheet or \nmeasured brightness/thermal results.\n\nPossible R318 options:\n10R: approximately 20 mA, initial commissioning population\n4.02R: approximately 50 mA\n2.00R: approximately 100 mA"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 311.15 191.516 0)
